<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-13146] OpenCensus example does not work from release build</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-13146</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;This happens in a binary distribution of 2.9:&lt;/p&gt;

